  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New features:\n- XLSX: number format for all currency symbols\n- Load and read data from Strict Open XML Spreadsheet file format\n- XLSB: Read formatted values into DataSet or List structures\n- XLSX: Read formatted values into XML file \n- XLSB: Read formatted values into XML file\n- XLS: Read and load data from Excel 95 files\n- Display Right-to-Left property for sheet\n\nImprovements:\n- Debug message for license file setup for easier integration\n- New method that returns library version\n- New method that returns library path on hdd\n\nBug fixes:\n- XLSX: read date values on Windows operating system on different language than English\n- XLSM: fix for loading complex VB project\n- XLSX: read formula values into XML file\n- XLSX: read numeric values with multiple decimals into XML file\n- XLSX: fix for OpenOffice in .NET (Core) version",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "EasyXLS .NET Professional",
  "verbatimVersion": "9.3.0",
